<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Gavana | PixelCraft Studio - Graphic Designer in Kenya</title>
<style>
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
body { background:#0f0f0f; color:white; }
header { padding:20px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
.logo { font-size:24px; font-weight:bold; color:#ff5da2; }
.logo span { color:white; }
nav a { color:white; text-decoration:none; margin-left:15px; font-size:14px; }
.hero { text-align:center; padding:60px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ff5da2,#7b2ff7); }
.hero h1 { font-size:38px; margin-bottom:10px; }
.hero p { font-size:16px; opacity:0.9; }
.btn { display:inline-block; margin-top:20px; background:white; color:#111; padding:12px 25px; border-radius:30px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; }
.section { padding:40px 20px; max-width:900px; margin:auto; }
.section h2 { text-align:center; margin-bottom:20px; font-size:26px; color:#ff5da2; }
.about { text-align:center; line-height:1.6; color:#ddd; }
.grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:15px; }
.card { background:#1e1e1e; padding:20px; border-radius:15px; text-align:center; }
.card h3 { margin-bottom:8px; }
.card p { color:#bbb; font-size:14px; }
.work img { width:100%; border-radius:12px; background:#333; height:180px; object-fit:cover; }
.contact { text-align:center; background:#1e1e1e; padding:30px 20px; border-radius:15px; }
.contact a { display:block; background:#25D366; color:white; padding:12px; margin:10px 0; border-radius:10px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; }
.contact a.insta { background:#E1306C; }
footer { text-align:center; padding:20px; color:#777; font-size:13px; }
@media(max-width:600px){ .grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } .hero h1{font-size:30px;} }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">PixelCraft<span>Studio</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#work">Work</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <p>Hi, I'm</p>
  <h1>GAVANA</h1>
  <p>Graphic Designer in Kenya | Logos, Posters, Flyers & Brand Design</p>
  <a class="btn" href="#work">View My Work ↓</a>
</div>

<div class="section" id="about">
  <h2>About Me</h2>
  <p class="about">I'm Gavana, an aspiring graphic designer based in Kenya, passionate about creativity and digital design. I help businesses, churches, events and creators stand out with clean, bold and modern visuals.</p>
</div>

<div class="section" id="services">
  <h2>My Services</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>🎨 Logo Design</h3><p>Unique, memorable logos for your brand or business.</p><p><b>From Ksh 1,000</b></p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>📢 Poster / Flyer Design</h3><p>Eye-catching posters for events, church, business & parties.</p><p><b>From Ksh 500</b></p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>💼 Brand Design</h3><p>Business cards, letterheads, social media kits.</p><p><b>From Ksh 1,500</b></p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>📱 Social Media Graphics</h3><p>Instagram posts, banners, YouTube thumbnails.</p><p><b>From Ksh 500</b></p></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section" id="work">
  <h2>My Work</h2>
  <div class="grid work">
    <div class="card"><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/ff5da2/ffffff?text=Logo+Design+1"><p>Logo Design</p></div>
    <div class="card"><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/7b2ff7/ffffff?text=Poster+Design"><p>Event Poster</p></div>
    <div class="card"><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/25D366/ffffff?text=Flyer+Design"><p>Business Flyer</p></div>
    <div class="card"><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/FF9800/ffffff?text=Brand+Design"><p>Brand Design</p></div>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:15px; color:#aaa; font-size:13px;">Replace these pictures with your own designs later.</p>
</div>

<div class="section" id="contact">
  <h2>Let's Work Together</h2>
  <div class="contact">
    <p>Ready for a design? Talk to me now:</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/254713563337">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    <a class="insta" href="https://instagram.com/pixelcraftscreative">Follow on Instagram</a>
    <p style="margin-top:10px; color:#bbb;">Email: pixelcraftstudio@gmail.com</p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>© 2026 PixelCraft Studio | Designed by Gavana in Kenya</footer>

</body>
</html>
